    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:3rem">
      <h2>Frequently asked</h2>
      <h3>What if I just want the free audit?</h3>
      <p>The free version lives at <a href="/audit/" class="inline-link">/audit/</a>, covers five points on two pages, tends to land in roughly a week, and asks for no card up front. The two products are designed to coexist, and the paid one is meant for buyers who want depth.</p>

      <h3>How is this different from a discovery call?</h3>
      <p>A <a href="/contact/" class="inline-link">discovery call</a> is a twenty-minute conversation about whether we are the right fit for one another. The audit, by contrast, is a written diagnostic of your existing site, complete with metrics and prioritization, and the two are genuinely different products.</p>

      <h3>What if my site is on Wix, Squarespace, or WordPress?</h3>
      <p>It does not matter for the audit. I evaluate the live site rather than the platform underneath, and if the platform itself happens to be part of the problem the audit will say so. The deliverable, however, is platform-agnostic findings.</p>

      <h3>Can the audit be a corporate purchase order?</h3>
      <p>Yes, it can. Email me directly and I can invoice through Stripe with a PO number attached, on NET-15 terms.</p>
